{"parse": {"title": "命运的雨季-02", "pageid": 123674, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%AD%A3-01\" title=\"命运的雨季-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">命运的雨季-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E8%BF%90%E7%9A%84%E9%9B%A8%E5%AD%A3-03\" title=\"命运的雨季-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">命运的雨季</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.89.80.E7.9F.A5.E7.9A.84.E6.9C.AA.E7.9F.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"所知的未知\">所知的未知</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 所知的未知</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">To Answer the Unanswerable</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这位客人究竟是什么来头？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>真不讲理！就这么打断了我和妈妈重要的谈话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>古怪的客人进门后，贝丽尔便按照日常接待的流程，领着对方去了水晶陈列室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>妈妈平常也不会接待打烊后来的客人，今天这是怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_15.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_15\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_15\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_2_bg_15.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_15.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_2_bg_15.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_15.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_2_bg_15.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_15.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩无法介入母亲与客人的谈话，但好奇心依旧驱使她在陈列室外竖起了耳朵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>工房深处，剔透的光晕将身处其中的人影折叠成万花筒里的碎片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>人们都说，想获得贝丽尔·布翁尼的预言，要给出相应的诚意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您的客人们于是选择购入超出其需求的水晶。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>而您也满足于这典型的商人逻辑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>打理生意并不简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您误会了。这并非价值评判。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>只是——我也会给出我的“诚意”，这份“诚意”不会让身为占卜师的您失望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达竖耳捕捉空气中溢散的语句，双眼紧盯地面上的阴影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，您想看一眼我的“未来”吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>也许您所求的就在这一瞥之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304146.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-304146.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304146.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304146.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-304146.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304146.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-304146.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304146.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>妈妈的……所求？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>陈列室内落针可闻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>呵呵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声浅笑之后，玛蒂尔达目睹阴影之中坠落一枚灵摆的摇动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304140.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304140.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304140.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304140.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304140.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304140.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304140.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304140.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>噢……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轻盈却醇浓的力量铺展在室内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>满室的水晶微微颤动，它们跟随占卜师的召唤绽放出耀眼的光芒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>光辉不断膨胀，似乎想要跃出这狭小的空间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>嗯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，您看见了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>疑问轻轻地落下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>叮——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_15.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_15\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_15\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_2_bg_15.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_15.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_2_bg_15.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_15.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_2_bg_15.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_15.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如同水晶与硬物相撞的声音。紧接着，耳鸣钻入神经。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304144.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304144.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304144.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304144.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304144.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304144.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304144.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304144.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唔！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>突然，闪耀的光芒开始在明灭之间挣扎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304143.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-304143.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304143.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304143.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-304143.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304143.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-304143.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304143.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>怎么回事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>水晶接连滚落至地板，附着其上的光芒也开始凋零。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，光线倏而收束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>先是占卜师手中的灵摆，接着由近及远，陈列着的水晶遽然迸裂，无数碎片飞溅出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>怎么会……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师的身影一顿，不由地略微后退。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304143.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-304143.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304143.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304143.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-304143.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304143.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/18/HeadIconSmall-304143.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304143.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>妈妈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>顾不上叮嘱，女儿连忙跑向母亲身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>天哪，妈妈，你的手流血了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这位客人，不管你有什么目的，这里都不欢迎你！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达愤怒转身，一步踏在母亲身前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>看来现在不是一个聊天的好时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>玛蒂尔达命令你，立刻离开工房！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那些往日的教导，女孩全抛在了脑后。她下达了逐客令，只想将危险与母亲隔绝开来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>许久，一声隐约的叹息消融了对峙的紧绷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如同水晶皲裂时的细小嗡鸣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>玛蒂尔达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩转过头。母亲的手抚上她的脸颊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>温凉的触感，仿佛是初从地脉深处被挖掘出的矿石，尚未沾染任何人的体温。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304144.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304144.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304144.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304144.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304144.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304144.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304144.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304144.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>妈妈……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>今天，你做了一个决定，饱含你的热情与意志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/HeadIconSmall-313401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>除此之外，没有其他事值得你在今日铭记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304144.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304144.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304144.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304144.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304144.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304144.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304144.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304144.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>困顿钻入神志的缝隙，不由分说地要阖上女孩的双眼，抹平她起伏的思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>这件事如此重要，它耗费了你所有精力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313422.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-313422.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313422.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313422.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-313422.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313422.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e3/HeadIconSmall-313422.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313422.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>因此，你现在——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304140.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304140.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304140.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304140.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304140.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304140.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-304140.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304140.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>我……要好好休息……才有精力为转学……做准备……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"313421.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"313421.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-313421.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-313421.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>好孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩陷入了黑暗。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>椴花茶氤氲着芬芳，但对坐的两人对此毫无兴趣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>端上茶水的主人也仅抿了一口，便再也没有拿起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这壶茶的滋味，在今天到来之前早已向她揭晓，她的品尝不过是验证昨日的再现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>您的干脆利落出乎我的意料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>您不希望谈话被打扰。满足客人的需求，是生意人的必要素养。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我也不会否认，这罕见地满足了交易双方的需求。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_15.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_15\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_15\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_2_bg_15.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_15.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_2_bg_15.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_15.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Cg-3_2_bg_15.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_15.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>陈列室内，玛蒂尔达靠坐在墙壁上，安静地睡着了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_2_bg_13\"><img alt=\"3_2_bg_13\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/600px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/900px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/Cg-3_2_bg_13.png/1200px-Cg-3_2_bg_13.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>那么，贝丽尔女士，您看到了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>了解彼此的身份，是交流的前提。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>这位客人，我该怎么称呼您？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>呵呵……对您来说，这样需要以言语明晰身份的时刻相当稀奇，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>占卜师再次观察起眼前的“人”，酝酿表达。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>您不同于我认识的任何人类或神秘学家，您游离在我本应知晓的预兆之外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我只能判断您是预言也无法容纳的“异质”存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>——请原谅我冒昧的表述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>无妨，请继续。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>在您身上，酝酿着灵摆难以透视的迷蒙、晦暗——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>还有逡巡在我耳边，无穷无尽、不知端倪、难以析清的呼唤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对方甫一进门，一缕混沌的潮湿便弥漫在室内。那是最不适宜某些水晶存放的环境。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宛如一场暴雨来临前的闷热。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>您的“诚意”我收到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>我看不到您的未来。您的一生不向我敞开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>对于一个号称可见一切的占卜师而言，这样的礼物并不寒酸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>您并不意外这个结果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>那么，您所求的是什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>噢，平等交易的价码。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，在您的人生中，上一次落入疑问的谷底该追溯到何时？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>“命运”的图谱中，万物都有其注定的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>时间失去了线性的意义，遮蔽也成为徒劳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>因为您看得到万事万物曾经的去往、当下的停驻和未来的等待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>唯有一场雨——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>噢，是的，您见过，我也知晓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>白袍子向来吝啬，为您遮雨，却用欺瞒剥夺了您看清这场雨的权利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>……一场自地面倒流而上的雨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>一场预言之外的“雨”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贝丽尔：</div><div>一如您今日的造访。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>1999年末，在基金会提供的安全屋内，贝丽尔目睹了“雨水”的倒流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这场雨，何时开始？如何诞生？为何出现？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>生平第一次得知的未知，携着连绵的疑问和新奇随雨水一同降临。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>贝丽尔注视着相隔一窗的雨，无法移开视线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>我所求的非常简单。来自占卜师的一句启示，一声点拨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>一个面对无人能答之问的回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501920.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501920.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/24/HeadIconSmall-501920.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501920.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>贝丽尔女士，您可以称呼我为阿尔卡纳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-501901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-501901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3a/HeadIconSmall-501901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿尔卡纳：</div><div>——我想知道，您是怎么看待“暴雨”的？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "命运的雨季-02"}}